Project: Instant Meshes
URL: https://github.com/wjakob/instant-meshes
License: BSD-3-Clause (see LICENSE.txt)
Upstream: wjakob/instant-meshes
Local modifications:
  - Blender CMakeLists.txt builds the remeshing core only (no NanoGUI / viewer / CLI).
  - patches/blender.patch: oneTBB compatibility, VectorXf setA, nprocs, optional field iterations.
  - Uses Blender's Eigen and TBB; header-only deps under ext/{dset,pcg32,pss}.
